  "solution": "Given equation: 15 × 6 + 132 – 11 ÷ 44 = 58\n\n1. + and ×\n\n15 + 6 × 132 – __**11 ÷ 44**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 15 + __**6 **____**×**____** 132**__ – 0.25 = 58\n\n⇒ __**15 + 79**____**2**__ – 0.25 = 58\n\n⇒ 807 – 0.25 = 58\n\n⇒ 806.25 ≠ 58\n\n2. + and ÷\n\n15 × 6 ÷ 132 – 11 + 44 = 58\n\n⇒ 15 × **__6 __****__÷__****__ 132__** – 11 + 44 = 58\n\n⇒ __15 × ____0.045__ – 11 + 44 = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.68**__ – 11 __**+ 44**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 44.68 – 11 = 58\n\n⇒ 33.68 ≠ 58\n\n3. ÷ and –\n\n15 × 6 + __**132 ÷ 11**__ - 44 = 58\n\n⇒ __**15 × 6 **__+ 12 - 44 = 58\n\n⇒ __**90**____** + 12**__ - 44 = 58\n\n⇒ 102 - 44 = 58\n\n⇒ 58 = 58\n\n4. × and ÷\n\n**15 ÷ 6** + 132 – __**11 × 44**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**2.5 + 132**__ – 484 = 58\n\n⇒ 134.5 – 484 = 58\n\n⇒ -349.5 ≠ 58\n\nHence, '**÷ and –**' is the correct answer.",
